WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:23.708
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:23.978 --> 01:28.859
[Apocalypse Log 12]

3
01:39.041 --> 01:41.250
Hang in there.

4
01:41.250 --> 01:44.375
I'll find a safe place to treat your wound.

5
01:44.375 --> 01:46.708
I'm fine.

6
01:46.708 --> 01:48.250
Put me down.

7
01:48.250 --> 01:50.167
I can walk on my own.

8
01:50.167 --> 01:51.662
You're still acting tough.

9
01:51.662 --> 01:54.586
If you fall again, I'll have to carry you anyway.

10
02:15.333 --> 02:17.291
The arrow was poisoned.

11
03:05.041 --> 03:07.291
The toxic blood is finally cleared out.

12
03:07.291 --> 03:08.916
You...

13
03:42.625 --> 03:44.166
You jerk.

14
03:44.166 --> 03:46.666
Meeting you was my misfortune.

15
03:53.833 --> 03:55.875
Get well soon.

16
04:38.583 --> 04:40.625
Your fever is finally gone.

17
04:50.916 --> 04:53.166
Leave me be.

18
04:53.166 --> 04:55.000
Go.

19
05:36.166 --> 05:38.666
It's yours now.

20
05:38.666 --> 05:40.541
Protect yourself.

21
05:57.708 --> 05:58.708
I'm going with you,

22
05:58.708 --> 06:01.541
but that doesn't mean I'm your prisoner.

23
06:01.541 --> 06:03.417
Reaching the headquarters as soon as possible...

24
06:03.417 --> 06:06.166
is best for everyone.

25
06:06.166 --> 06:07.833
Don't forget.

26
06:07.833 --> 06:09.208
He's a hunter.

27
06:09.208 --> 06:10.917
You're just his prey.

28
06:10.917 --> 06:13.458
Just a lab rat he needs to catch.

29
06:19.458 --> 06:21.625
Detect if the target is an immune.

30
06:21.625 --> 06:23.708
Target confirmed as an immune.

31
06:23.708 --> 06:26.875
Taming a dog that bites is simple.

32
06:27.500 --> 06:31.000
You just have to pull out its fangs.

33
06:31.000 --> 06:33.542
You bastard.

34
06:33.542 --> 06:36.458
And here I was, trusting you and thinking we were friends.

35
06:36.458 --> 06:39.458
I only need to ensure you're alive.

36
06:43.333 --> 06:45.833
Let go, you bastard!

37
06:45.833 --> 06:51.167
Don't force me to use the methods I use on others...

38
06:53.792 --> 06:55.333
Let's go.

39
06:55.333 --> 06:58.792
If you stay any longer, you won't be able to leave.

40
06:58.792 --> 07:01.417
Now is your best chance.

41
07:41.667 --> 07:43.458
Lin Zai...

42
07:46.625 --> 07:48.417
Lin Zai...

43
07:49.333 --> 07:51.167
Don't leave me behind.

44
08:26.750 --> 08:29.042
No, please, no...

45
08:40.167 --> 08:44.042
Mom, Dad...

46
08:47.083 --> 08:48.750
You're useless.

47
08:48.750 --> 08:50.458
If you can't get up on your own,

48
08:50.458 --> 08:52.208
then just rot right here.

49
08:52.208 --> 08:54.000
Wait for death.

50
09:10.625 --> 09:12.917
Don't go.

51
09:12.917 --> 09:15.000
Don't leave me behind.

52
10:58.042 --> 11:00.167
Why did you come back?

53
11:02.417 --> 11:04.958
You could have just left.

54
11:06.042 --> 11:08.539
Even if you had abandoned me today,

55
11:08.539 --> 11:11.039
I wouldn't have been surprised.

56
11:11.833 --> 11:13.589
I'm used to it.

57
11:16.750 --> 11:18.667
Used to what?

58
11:20.583 --> 11:22.875
Used to being abandoned.

59
11:26.250 --> 11:28.833
Discarding others to save yourself...

60
11:28.833 --> 11:31.500
Isn't that just human instinct?

61
11:36.542 --> 11:40.500
In critical moments, even your own parents,

62
11:40.500 --> 11:43.167
and comrades you've faced death with...

63
11:46.000 --> 11:48.333
cannot be trusted.

64
12:00.375 --> 12:02.167
You...

65
12:04.000 --> 12:06.250
Why did you come back?

66
12:14.083 --> 12:15.917
Lie.

67
12:17.375 --> 12:19.750
I'm not like them.

68
12:22.917 --> 12:25.028
I have a heart.

69
12:27.583 --> 12:30.125
- S-So... - Listen, Lie.

70
12:32.998 --> 12:36.708
If I go with you, will I die?

71
13:01.083 --> 13:03.208
I will protect you...

72
13:05.083 --> 13:06.958
with my life.

73
15:26.708 --> 15:28.583
Is that enough?
